    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/48bac7-4/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=593252431790342896&sectionId=593252431908111088)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDaOA15eaj_text","label":"ggDaOA15eaj_text","default":"Turn On the Light. Turn Up the Glow."},{"type":"html","id":"ggDwj8_wWBf_text","label":"ggDwj8_wWBf_text","default":"<p>Experience the magic of red, blue, and amber light for smooth, radiant skin.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkKtAcij7J_text","label":"ggkKtAcij7J_text","default":"<p>Red Light Therapy</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg45vFKB4PE_text","label":"gg45vFKB4PE_text","default":"<p>Boosts collagen, reduces fine lines, and rejuvenates tired skin.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPpGsL7sXx_text","label":"ggPpGsL7sXx_text","default":"<p>Blue Light Therapy</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJhtmpniEa_text","label":"ggJhtmpniEa_text","default":"<p>Targets acne, calms breakouts, clears skin, helps unclog pores, and calms irritated skin.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggleKWxHNC9_text","label":"ggleKWxHNC9_text","default":"<p>Amber Light Therapy</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvPpJD-N1F_text","label":"ggvPpJD-N1F_text","default":"<p>Soothes redness, evens tone, and supports healing. Perfect for dull, stressed-out skin that needs a peaceful reset</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRnLH1KW6M_text","label":"ggRnLH1KW6M_text","default":"Protect your most visible appearance"},{"type":"html","id":"gghTxE1JEgq_text","label":"gghTxE1JEgq_text","default":"<p>Our face is our most recognizable feature, to ourselves and to others.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggc3SIo-z5Q_text","label":"ggc3SIo-z5Q_text","default":"<p>It's our calling card to the world. Years of exposure to the sun and environmental toxins lead to wrinkles, pigmentation, redness, and acne - all visible signs of aging and skin damage.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQeV9e1HJ-_text","label":"ggQeV9e1HJ-_text","default":"<p>The Regenmask™ utilizes recognized and NASA-used therapeutic LED technology. It offers you a safe and cost-effective solution to all your anti-aging and acne woes. It is simple, convenient, and totally safe.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPM_OD1hHi_text","label":"ggPM_OD1hHi_text","default":"<p>We use the most clinically effective LEDs available !</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6RarY8prr_text","label":"gg6RarY8prr_text","default":"<p>In just 15 to 30 minutes a day, you can embrace a whole new you!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6lInRjUzU_text","label":"gg6lInRjUzU_text","default":"<p>| Based on 629 reviews</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRVijsNkRA_text","label":"ggRVijsNkRA_text","default":"Why Customers Love Novalight™ - Regenmask"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCa8xLwpcg_text","label":"ggCa8xLwpcg_text","default":"<p>Highly recommend!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggao1xB6Ysb_text","label":"ggao1xB6Ysb_text","default":"<p>I have only been using it for a month. Prior to using this my skin was flaky &amp; dry. My skin barrier has been severely damaged for the past 2 years where almost anything I use burns, but in 1 month this mask has lightened my hyperpigmentation considerably as well as helped to give a bit</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggH9Kx3_hqa_text","label":"ggH9Kx3_hqa_text","default":"<p>—Aimee.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggytYBYrnCN_text","label":"ggytYBYrnCN_text","default":"<p>IT REALLY WORKS!!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxEkl6glGT_text","label":"ggxEkl6glGT_text","default":"<p>After years of searching for an effective wrinkle treatment, I finally found a game-changer with this LED mask therapy. Six months in, the results are astonishing! I’ve used countless serums and devices with no success until now. This LED mask is definitely worth the investment.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM19vTj5OP_text","label":"ggM19vTj5OP_text","default":"<p>—BJ Nardi.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggi6AXMoNKd_text","label":"ggi6AXMoNKd_text","default":"<p>Completely CURED my acne</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHMolIHj_9_text","label":"ggHMolIHj_9_text","default":"<p>I have been battling dark spots for years, trying everything under the sun. When I came across this LED mask, I was hesitant but decided to give it a try. After 6 months of consistent use, the improvement is remarkable! My dark spots have significantly faded. This LED mask is truly worth every penny.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggECNERHHTz_text","label":"ggECNERHHTz_text","default":"<p>—Terri P.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjeEPUzAHz_text","label":"ggjeEPUzAHz_text","default":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_0","label":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is there scientific evidence for LED light therapy ?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_1","label":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_1","default":"<p>Is LED light therapy painful?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_2","label":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_2","default":"<p>Can I use skincare products at the same time as my Novalight mask ?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_3","label":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_3","default":"<p>How often should the device be used ?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_4","label":"ggM_f2g-aQq_childItem_4","default":"<p>Do I need eye protection ?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFag0SyHPv_text","label":"ggFag0SyHPv_text","default":"<p>LED light therapy has been thoroughly tested, evaluated, and validated by hundreds of universities, medical labs, and most notably by NASA. In fact, over 2000 reports and documents have been written on this technology.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gaRjC3FbZm9_text","label":"gaRjC3FbZm9_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">No, it does not cause any pain. It even provides a feeling of relaxation.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gUNlCkSROcv_text","label":"gUNlCkSROcv_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">Yes, you can. In fact, the results of your light therapy will be more dramatic if you use high-quality skincare products. Additionally, you can use your acne-fighting products to speed up the healing process for your skin.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gP66e8Cuqr7_text","label":"gP66e8Cuqr7_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">The suggested usage time is 10 to 20 minutes. It is most appropriate to start with a 10-minute treatment, 4 times a week to begin, unless otherwise directed by a doctor. Once you have achieved your initial goals, it is more than likely you will only need to use the device twice a week. Since the LEDs provide a pure and powerful output, these few treatments will be sufficient.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"guxmczcTxO-_text","label":"guxmczcTxO-_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(247,253,250);color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\">The design of this mask does not cover the eye area, so there is no need to wear eye protection during treatments. However, it is advisable to avoid looking directly at the LED and to close your eyes during the treatment.</span></p>"}],
